Historical note: reference float math
-------------------------------------

Earlier InferSSD development revisions included a CUDA float reference
component translated from glibc and fdlibm routines. Its expf algorithm and
32-entry exp2f table originate in ARM optimized-routines
(https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines, math/expf.c and
math/exp2f_data.c, Copyright (c) 2017-2018 Arm Limited, MIT). The glibc
copies carried LGPL-2.1-or-later notices and the fdlibm copies carried Sun
Microsystems notices. That component is not part of this source tree. This
note acknowledges its origin and does not relicense it.

